BT /F1 10.5 Tf 12.6 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 38 441 Tm (Use plausible, positive continuum models that are smooth across the actual common boundary, including alternatives outside the fitted C0 family. Preserve the) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 38 427 Tm (shared SM-resonance and signal construction, the simultaneous SR+CR geometry and all measured nuisance uncertainties. Prioritise mass hypotheses close to the) Tj T* ET
