BT 1 0 0 1 38 355 Tm (boundary placement. Retain invalid toys and numerical failures in the reporting; use one Condor job per toy with reproducible seeds.) Tj T* ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 13.2 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 38 326 Tm (4. State the validation limits and decision before adoption.) Tj T* ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 12.6 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 38 311 Tm (Closure when both generation and fitting use the same C0 construction is not sufficient to establish robustness to a smooth true background. Define acceptance) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 38 297 Tm (criteria before inspecting this comparison. Keep C0 as the current candidate pending validation; do not select the junction prescription to move observed limits into) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 38 283 Tm (expected bands. The measured trigger uncertainty remains unchanged and profiled in nominal inference.) Tj T* ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 10.8 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 38 20 Tm (Planned checks | No new campaign launched) Tj T* ET
